	"Description": "Runtime Audio Importer is an open-source plugin for importing audio of various formats at runtime, including MP3, WAV, FLAC, OGG Vorbis, OGG Opus, BINK, and RAW (int8, uint8, int16, uint16, int32, uint32, float32).",
	"Category": "Audio",
